rants from Academy of Finland (P.M.O,) including also Centres of Excellence in Translational Genome-Scale Biology (P.M.O) and Cancer Biology (ML, KA). Additional funds were obtained from the Academy of Finland research program for Systems Biology and Bioinformatics (PMO), Finnish Cancer Foundations (PMO, ML, KA), Sigrid Juselius Foundation (PMO, KA), and from the European Union (FP6 INCA project LSHC-CT-2005&#x02013;018704) (PMO).</p></fn><fn id="ack3" fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing interests.</bold> The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>